      "created_at": "2018-11-15T20:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You could just have no tiebreaker, and each pair of players continues to play until one wins and the other loses. 1st repeat is on Advanced, 2nd is on Challenge, 3rd and further are on Ultimate =)</p>",
