      "created_at": "2018-11-15T21:01:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Some Ultimates could still go on for a long time before someone loses (and a few could take many tries until someone wins).&nbsp; And if we're talking about a tournament, skill differentials narrow the longer it goes on--you could have a whole lot of games before one wins and one loses.</p>",
